OL,3,GNEWSATheatre faces being replaced but
OL,4,Ashow must go on
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepairs and improvements are continuing
OL,7,Fto be carried out on a town theatre
OL,8,Feven though the director admits the
OL,9,Faging venue "needs to be replaced".
OL,11,FLaura James, director of the Wyvern
OL,12,FTheatre in Swindon, has been overseeing
OL,13,Fa series of small improvements, such as
OL,14,Fre-upholstering seating, but she says
OL,15,Fthe town "needs and deserves a bigger
OL,16,Fand brand new venue".
OL,18,FSwindon Borough Council recently said
OL,19,Fit would not be good value to spend
OL,20,Fmillions on the building but it does
OL,21,Fwant to keep the theatre open until a
OL,22,Fnew venue is finished.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
